        "In the year 2020, the Swedish National Agency for Education implemented a change and transitioned from reporting expenditure per academic year to calendar year. Statistics for academic year 2006/07–2018/19 is presented in the table [Expenditure on Swedish schools abroad. Academic year](https://www.statistikdatabasen.scb.se/pxweb/eng/ssd/START__UF__UF0514/UtbKostUtland). This represents a break in time series and expenditure for the autumn semester of 2019 are not included in any of the tables."
